(7680412, 1256316, 30049, '<td valign="top">Must have been taken one or two frames after this one.  :-)<br/> <br/><a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1239747" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/2000-2999/2882/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1239747.jpg" xalt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/2000-2999/2882/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1239747.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/2000-2999/2882/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1239747.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''"/></a> <br/> <br/>Of what has been entered (that I have seen thus far) this is one of the more interesting images.  Not sure if the highlights should be closer to white or not without seeing it - the highlights now are closer to upper-level grey tones.</td>', 'Must have been taken one or two frames after this one.  :-)   Of what has been entered (that I have seen thus far) this is one of the more interesting images.  Not sure if the highlights should be closer to white or not without seeing it - the highlights now are closer to upper-level grey tones.', '2020-11-29 16:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680413, 1256579, 30049, '<td valign="top">Tones are a bit middle-ground rather than stretching to reach a high contrast state.  JMO.  Good luck.  Interesting place (think I''ve seen it before on a recent challenge?)</td>', 'Tones are a bit middle-ground rather than stretching to reach a high contrast state.  JMO.  Good luck.  Interesting place (think I''ve seen it before on a recent challenge?)', '2020-11-29 16:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680414, 1256545, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice scene but heavy middle grey tone IMO.  Some black in there, but not very much.</td>', 'Nice scene but heavy middle grey tone IMO.  Some black in there, but not very much.', '2020-11-29 16:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680415, 1256514, 30049, '<td valign="top">Unique!  I like it.</td>', 'Unique!  I like it.', '2020-11-29 16:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680416, 1256411, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is high contrast.  Well seen and captured.  Little bit of an optical illusion I think, but it "feels" like it''s tilting left.  When I straight line it using the main boat in the middle it does measure level.  Just the way the elements play out I think.  Good luck.  One of my top picks.</td>', 'This is high contrast.  Well seen and captured.  Little bit of an optical illusion I think, but it "feels" like it''s tilting left.  When I straight line it using the main boat in the middle it does measure level.  Just the way the elements play out I think.  Good luck.  One of my top picks.', '2020-11-29 16:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680417, 1256531, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very cool POV!  Well played.</td>', 'Very cool POV!  Well played.', '2020-11-29 16:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680418, 1256358, 30049, '<td valign="top">Lovely girl.  Very neutral tones overall.</td>', 'Lovely girl.  Very neutral tones overall.', '2020-11-29 16:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
