(7680423, 1256439, 30049, '<td valign="top">Yikes!</td>', 'Yikes!', '2020-11-29 16:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680424, 1256571, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Once you get to the woman in the middle distance you''ve lost focus and detail.  Some of it may be to post and heavy noise reduction?  I''m curious to see what aperture this was taken at.  A wee bit crispy on the sharpening also (getting some pronounced jaggies).</td>', 'Nice idea.  Once you get to the woman in the middle distance you''ve lost focus and detail.  Some of it may be to post and heavy noise reduction?  I''m curious to see what aperture this was taken at.  A wee bit crispy on the sharpening also (getting some pronounced jaggies).', '2020-11-29 16:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
