(7680709, 1256562, 138630, '<td valign="top">Oh my, your first ribbon!  Congratulations and way to hang in there - 160 challenges.  This has great design elements and I love the tones.  I do think <img border="0" src="https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif" xalt="'' . substr(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''"/> <a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=4008" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">willem</a> has a good idea . . . but for now, just sit back and enjoy :)</td>', 'Oh my, your first ribbon!  Congratulations and way to hang in there - 160 challenges.  This has great design elements and I love the tones.  I do think  willem has a good idea . . . but for now, just sit back and enjoy :)', '2020-12-02 00:24:20.000000', NULL, 0),
