(7680729, 1256545, 30049, '<td valign="top">Oh, I definitely gave it some consideration (regardless of what score I gave this).  Hurts to hear the truth of what someone has to say about your entry?  Not really getting the correlation between these misstatements in your photographer comments.  ???<br/> <br/><i>"My misjudgment led to a mediocre voting result. I normally tick the comments as helpful no matter what, but not this time."</i> <br/> <br/>I don''t really care if my comments are marked helpful or not.  I make them most of the time on a spur of the moment whim.  I do like to go back after a challenge is over and see if my comments lined up with observations made by others.   and also to read the Photographers comments when available.  <br/> <br/>Best of luck to you.  FWIW - I do like your image as a standalone; just not quite what I expected to see in this challenge.  :-)</td>', 'Oh, I definitely gave it some consideration (regardless of what score I gave this).  Hurts to hear the truth of what someone has to say about your entry?  Not really getting the correlation between these misstatements in your photographer comments.  ??? "My misjudgment led to a mediocre voting result. I normally tick the comments as helpful no matter what, but not this time."  I don''t really care if my comments are marked helpful or not.  I make them most of the time on a spur of the moment whim.  I do like to go back after a challenge is over and see if my comments lined up with observations made by others.   and also to read the Photographers comments when available.   Best of luck to you.  FWIW - I do like your image as a standalone; just not quite what I expected to see in this challenge.  :-)', '2020-12-02 09:28:29.000000', NULL, 0),
